Thanks Daniel. I like this much better than my version. I don't know
how to tweak the variables, though. I think the maximum score would
have to be a tight upper limit to what most people could expect to get
in a regular game, otherwise the same problem would arise: kill-crazy
players would always have higher scores than regular players. I suspect
the best way to figure this out would be to get some sample data that
breaks down the components people's scores, maybe from one of the
public nethack servers.

